  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into fries.\n• Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683931abf7d5496ac4a6e7f4/step-6e534e00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile grate carrot. Drain and rinse cannellini beans. Halve continental rolls.\n• When fries have 10 mins remaining, bake continental rolls on a second lined oven tray until heated through, 2-3 mins.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook cannellini beans until softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in garlic seasoning and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683931abf7d5496ac4a6e7f4/step-cab1ea10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the water, brown sugar and butter to the beans and simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and lightly mash beans with a potato masher or fork. Season with salt and pepper to taste.\n• Remove rolls from oven, then top with bean mixture. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and bake until golden and melted, 5 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683931abf7d5496ac4a6e7f4/step-01ef1e20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine carrot, salad leaves and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Divide baked bean-loaded rolls between plates.\n• Serve with carrot salad and fries.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683931abf7d5496ac4a6e7f4/step-77afec30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
